        <rdfs:label>Refrigerant</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Refrigerant"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A refrigerant is a working fluid used in the refrigeration cycle of air conditioning systems and heat pumps where in most cases they undergo a repeated phase transition from a liquid to a gas and back again.</skos:definition>
