        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.coopermedc.com/products/manual-alarm-call-points"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Manual alarm call points are designed for the purpose of raising an alarm manually once verification of a fire or emergency condition exists. by operating the push button or break glass the alarm signal can be raised.</skos:definition>
        <sh:rule>na99033713e994d3fac6c613af3f33cc0b1103</sh:rule>
