        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manual_fire_alarm_activation#Fire_alarm_pull_station"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An active fire protection device (usually wall-mounted) that when activated initiates an alarm on a fire alarm system. In its simplest form the user activates the alarm by pulling the handle down.</skos:definition>
