        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thermostatic_mixing_valve"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A valve that blends hot water with cold water to ensure constant, safe shower and bath outlet temperatures, preventing scalding.</skos:definition>
